OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe odd
OL,6,Flight shower aroud to start this
OL,7,Fevening, turning drier with clear
OL,8,Fspells, allowing temperatures to drop
OL,9,Foff, with some mist and fog patches
OL,10,Fdeveloping in prone locations under
OL,11,Flight winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FAgain, a bright start for
OL,14,Fmany, leading into patchy clouds and
OL,15,Fsunny spells through Tuesday. A
OL,16,Flargely drier day, with around average
OL,17,Ftemperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
