OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FVariable cloud with sunny spells over
OL,7,Fthe next few days with light showers
OL,8,Fwhere the cloud thickens. Winds
OL,9,Fstrengthening through Wednesday, with
OL,10,Fstronger gusts along southern
OL,11,Fcoastlines.
